  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 335.14,
   "end": 336.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "I haven't."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 336.0,
   "end": 338.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chiaotzu",
   "text": "Give it some time, you're hanging with the right crowd."
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 338.4,
   "end": 341.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "What should we even do now? I feel so helpless!"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 341.74,
   "end": 342.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Listen!"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 342.72,
   "end": 346.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Sometimes you gotta know when to hold 'em, and know when to fold 'em."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 347.04,
   "end": 349.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "And right now... it's foldin' time."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 349.64,
   "end": 351.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Pig! Grab M'Dick!"
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 351.3,
   "end": 353.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Oolong",
   "text": "*Please* tell me you mean the submarine..."
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 353.92,
   "end": 354.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Heh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 359.56,
   "end": 361.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "'Huh... not dead yet...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 362.62,
   "end": 364.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "'That's weir--oh there we go...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 364.38,
   "end": 365.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Aah! Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 365.54,
   "end": 368.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "(Continues to grunt in exhaustion)"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 370.48,
   "end": 377.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "You know, if you want my personal opinion, \"Kikouhou\" is a pretty sad choice of last words."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 377.66,
   "end": 383.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "But to be fair, it's far from the worst decision you've made today."
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 383.24,
   "end": 386.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Ki-kou-f**k yourself."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 386.34,
   "end": 389.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Aww, see? That's the spirit!"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 390.02,
   "end": 391.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mr. Popo",
   "text": "HE DEAD!"
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 391.14,
   "end": 395.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "NO! We can't just let him die like this! You gotta save him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 395.56,
   "end": 400.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "But I can't get him in time! There's no way I could move fast enough to grab him, get out, and..."
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 402.42,
   "end": 402.92,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "POP"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 403.76,
   "end": 406.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Did he just remember he can do that?"
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 406.46,
   "end": 407.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mr. Popo",
   "text": "Your father's an idiot."
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 408.3,
   "end": 408.88,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "POP"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 408.88,
   "end": 411.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Huh? *Goku*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 411.0,
   "end": 416.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, sorry! I'm just--I'm just here for my buddy. I'll be gone in a second. Let you get back to your business."
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 416.54,
   "end": 417.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Hold on, wha--"
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 417.42,
   "end": 418.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, hey! Piccolo's alive too!"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 417.42,
   "end": 420.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "(Gurgling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 420.86,
   "end": 422.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ooh, little waterlogged there, buddy?"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 422.86,
   "end": 424.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "I blew a hole in him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 424.62,
   "end": 427.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "How durable is he? How durable am I...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 428.16,
   "end": 429.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Questions for later."
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 430.04,
   "end": 435.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "OK, I'm about done here. See ya tomorrow! Oh, and uh, by the way, Cell?"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 437.08,
   "end": 438.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "You're gonna die."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 438.9,
   "end": 439.44,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "POP"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 439.44,
   "end": 440.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 441.06,
   "end": 442.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "What...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 442.04,
   "end": 443.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "How...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 443.02,
   "end": 444.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Why...?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 444.3,
   "end": 447.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "I HAVE SO MANY QUESTIIOONS!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 448.26,
   "end": 450.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "And you're sure you're OK?"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 450.06,
   "end": 453.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Bulma, you know what I've been hit by; I'm fine."
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 453.08,
   "end": 454.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Now - you got the detonator?"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 454.98,
   "end": 456.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Yeah, right here!"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 456.0,
   "end": 460.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Now, listen; its signal is weak, so you'll have to be within ten meters of the Androids."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 460.6,
   "end": 464.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "So what you're saying is I have to get... close."
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 464.8,
   "end": 467.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Ehh-eh, thirty feet isn't that close..."
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 467.08,
   "end": 469.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Oh, I'm gonna get all up in that."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 469.12,
   "end": 471.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Well, you could use some protection, then."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 471.14,
   "end": 471.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Pardon?"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 471.74,
   "end": 474.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "I made you all battle suits, like Vegeta's!"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 474.22,
   "end": 474.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 474.92,
   "end": 479.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Well, thanks but I probably won't need it. I'm pretty good about pulling out before I get into trouble."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 479.42,
   "end": 482.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Besides, I tried one on Namek, but I got a huuge hole in it."
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 483.56,
   "end": 487.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "OK then! I'll just hand them out to everyone else. See you later!"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 487.04,
   "end": 488.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Thanks Bulma!"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 491.68,
   "end": 492.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Huh."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 492.52,
   "end": 495.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "This, uh... 'S remote's a lot heavier than I expected."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 497.96,
   "end": 498.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Huh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 499.44,
   "end": 500.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Are you two OK?"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 500.76,
   "end": 505.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Yeah. We may not have Dragon Balls, but I guess Senzu beans are a close second."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 505.78,
   "end": 510.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "It's a good thing I showed up when I did. Cell was about to sixty-nine ya."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 510.1,
   "end": 511.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Eighty-six, Dad. Eighty-six."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 511.98,
   "end": 513.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I'm not good with numbers."
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 513.36,
   "end": 517.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "I'll admit that was pretty ballsy, but all you did was stall him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 517.26,
   "end": 522.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Now he's alone to hunt down Android 18, and we don't have anyone with the strength to stop him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 522.28,
   "end": 523.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 522.28,
   "end": 524.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mr. Popo",
   "text": "Your worthless maggot friends are coming out!"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 524.94,
   "end": 526.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Or do we?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 526.16,
   "end": 528.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "No, Gohan; we haven't gone in yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 528.9,
   "end": 530.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "...Wow, really Goku?"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 547.26,
   "end": 549.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, Trunks! Wow, neat hair!"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 549.96,
   "end": 554.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "'Oh my God, first piece of positive reinforcement in over a year. Respond appropriately!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 554.86,
   "end": 557.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Thank you, I, grew it myself."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 557.18,
   "end": 557.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "'Dammit!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 558.36,
   "end": 560.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Huh. That's funny."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 560.56,
   "end": 561.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "'Roll with it.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 561.52,
   "end": 565.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "And hey, Vegeta! Wow, you guys sure got strong, huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 565.34,
   "end": 569.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "That's right, Kakarot... and you wouldn't believe just how much."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 569.16,
   "end": 575.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You see, while I was training in the depths of the Hyperbolic Time Chamber, I looked deep within myself and--"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 575.16,
   "end": 582.46,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Goku's POV, with \"Dadhi Dado Da\" playing in the background"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 575.16,
   "end": 582.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Blah blah blah blah blah, pride, blah blah, Prince of all, blah blah blah, Super Saiyan... blah blah blah."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 582.72,
   "end": 586.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "And through all of that, I have ascended."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 586.16,
   "end": 590.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "That's right - I have reached a new level. Do you hear me, Kakarot?"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 590.88,
   "end": 593.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I am finally stronger than you!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 593.32,
   "end": 593.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Neat!"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 593.92,
   "end": 594.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "F**k you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 594.94,
   "end": 598.44,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ Closing theme (DBZ intermission) ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 599.78,
   "end": 604.36,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "The mother of all Bilabial Trills (yes, it has a name)"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 617.44,
   "end": 618.96,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Captions by PyroAvok"
  }
 ],
