   "line_start": 67,
   "line_end": 71
  },
  {
   "start": 306.2,
   "end": 321.02,
   "title": "So *Freaking Nettled*",
   "quote": "...if you do that AGAIN... I will be so *freaking nettled*--! — Kikouhou. — Aw, DAMMIT!!!",
   "line_start": 100,
   "line_end": 104
  },
  {
   "start": 323.2,
   "end": 338.2,
   "title": "We've Literally All Done It",
   "quote": "Died, *yes*! Jesus, we've literally all done it! — I haven't. — Give it some time, you're hanging with the right crowd.",
   "line_start": 106,
   "line_end": 110
  },
  {
   "start": 341.3,
   "end": 354.48,
   "title": "Pig! Grab M'Dick!",
   "quote": "Sometimes you gotta know when to hold 'em... Pig! Grab M'Dick! — *Please* tell me you mean the submarine...",
   "line_start": 112,
   "line_end": 117
  },
  {
